s=s.replace("James's six supplied recordings", "James's sixteen supplied recordings")
s=s.replace('No station voice recordings have been supplied. These ten lines use an optional temporary browser system voice, with word-boundary mouth timing where supported. SYSTEM VOICE / OFF gives captions with timed mouth movement. The system voice is separate from James\'s supplied MP3 performances.', 'JBPA1.mp3 through JBPA10.mp3 now play James\'s ten station lines in order, with recording-driven mouth movement. Pausing stops his recording; Continue resumes the saved line and playback position. Revisited conversations use the same recordings.')
